```svelte
<script>
	let value = $state('a');
</script>

<select bind:value>
	<option value="a">A</option>
	<option value="b">B</option>
</select>
<p>{value}</p>
```

`src/routes/oneway/+page.svelte`
```svelte
<script>
	let value = $state('a');
</script>

<select {value} onchange={(e) => (value = e.currentTarget.value)}>
	<option value="a">A</option>
	<option value="b">B</option>
</select>
<p>{value}</p>
