### Describe the bug

In dev mode, after **hydration**, an element that comes after a component in the same template gets no `__svelte_meta`. Client-side `mount()` assigns it correctly. This also affects the Svelte Inspector, which reads `__svelte_meta.loc`, and any dev tooling built on that metadata.

```svelte
<!-- Card.svelte -->
<section>card</section>
```

```svelte
<!-- App.svelte -->
<script>
  import Card from './Card.svelte';
</script>

