[-] Packages
    - tauri 🦀: 2.12.2
    - tauri-build 🦀: 2.7.1
    - wry 🦀: 0.57.0
    - tao 🦀: 0.37.1
    - @tauri-apps/api  ⱼₛ: not installed!
